    "id": "docs:data/overview",
    "sourceKind": "documentation",
    "title": "Data",
    "locator": "Docs / Data / Overview",
    "excerpt": "The Data page is the central file registry for Liatir. Every tool and plugin draws its input files from here. You add files once; everything else in the app can see them.",
    "content": "The Data page is the central file registry for Liatir. Every tool and plugin draws its input files from here. You add files once; everything else in the app can see them."
