    "sourceKind": "documentation",
    "title": "Tools — Output files",
    "locator": "Docs / Tools / Overview / Output files",
    "excerpt": "Output files Some tools produce output files as part of their results. These appear in the results panel above the stats sections, with two actions: - **Add to Data** — registers the file in the Data library immediately, making it available as an input to the…",
    "content": "Output files\nSome tools produce output files as part of their results. These appear in the results panel above the stats sections, with two actions:\n\n- **Add to Data** — registers the file in the Data library immediately, making it available as an input to the next step.\n- **Save as…** — opens the system save dialog so you can copy the file to a location of your choice."
